    "body": "Thank you! So currently not possible, but it sounds like it's something we might see in the future if there's enough interest from developers and implementers. Very interested in hearing from annevk and Chromium engineers on this. Ideally it'd end up being as simple as adding a token to the `sandbox` attribute, or something like that.",
